Looking at this problem, I need to find a bijection between $A_n$ (partitions into alternating-parity subsequences) and $B_{n+1}$ (partitions into same-parity subsequences).

**Answer Leak Check:** The problem text contains no leaked solutions or answer hints. Proceeding.

